---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Section from '../../components/layout/Section.astro';
import Container from '../../components/layout/Container.astro';
import { FALLBACK_EMAIL } from '../../utils/forms/submit';
const mailto = 'mailto:' + FALLBACK_EMAIL;
const lastUpdated = '30 August 2026';
---
<PageLayout
  translationKey="legal-cookies"
  title="Cookie Policy"
  description="How Marlbridge uses cookies and similar technologies."
  path="/legal/cookies/"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  heading="Cookie Policy"
  headingFont="sans"
  lead={`Last updated ${lastUpdated}.`}
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Cookie Policy', href: '/legal/cookies/' }]}
>
  <Section surface="white">
    <Container width="prose">
      <div class="text-[17.5px] leading-[1.75] [&>h2]:mt-10 [&>h2]:text-[26px] [&>h2]:font-semibold [&>h2]:text-navy-800 [&>p]:mt-5 [&>ul]:mt-5 [&>ul]:ps-5 [&>ul>li]:mt-2">
        <h2>Short version</h2>
        <p>
          marlbridge.com is a static site. We use Google Analytics (GA4) to understand how visitors use the
          site, but only after you accept the cookie banner shown on your first visit -- no analytics cookie is
          set before that, and no analytics request is sent until you click Accept. We do not run advertising
          trackers, and we do not set any cookie of our own outside of that one opt-in analytics choice.
        </p>

        <h2>Google Analytics (GA4)</h2>
        <p>
          If you accept, Google Analytics sets cookies to distinguish visitors and measure page views, referral
          sources and general usage patterns. We have IP anonymisation enabled. This data is processed by Google
          under its own privacy policy. If you reject or ignore the banner, no Google Analytics cookie is set and
          no analytics request is sent -- your visit isn't measured.
        </p>

        <h2>Cloudflare Turnstile</h2>
        <p>
          The enquiry form on this site uses Cloudflare Turnstile, a privacy-preserving alternative to CAPTCHA,
          to reduce automated spam. Turnstile may set a short-lived cookie or use similar technology while you
          are completing the form, under Cloudflare's own privacy policy. This runs regardless of your analytics
          choice, because it is necessary for the form to function safely.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party requests</h2>
        <p>
          This site loads typefaces from Google Fonts. Loading a font causes your browser to request it directly
          from Google's servers, which may log your IP address and request details under Google's own privacy
          policy. We don't control what Google does with that request.
        </p>

        <h2>If that changes</h2>
        <p>
          If we later add a chat widget or a marketing tool that sets additional cookies, we'll update this
          page to describe what's used and how to opt out, and update the date above.
        </p>

        <h2>Controlling cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Use "Cookie Settings" in the footer of this page to change your analytics choice at any time -- it
          reopens the accept/reject banner so you can change your mind. Most browsers also let you block or clear cookies and site data in
          their privacy settings generally -- the site will still work, though fonts may fall back to your system
          default and analytics/Turnstile features may not function.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy: <a href={mailto} class="underline decoration-gold-500 underline-offset-2">{FALLBACK_EMAIL}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </Section>
</PageLayout>
